    "name": "discounts_and_affiliates",
    "title": "Volume discounts & affiliate program",
    "description": "Demonstrates service-provider volume-discount scenarios (threshold, graduated tiers, continuous formula, organization-level aggregation) and the affiliate program (links, fee accruals and the credit ledger).",
